<header><div class="shell nav"><a class="brand" href="#home"><span class="mark">✳</span><span>CHRISTMAS <b>TOY DRIVE</b><small>BY NATHAN TABOR · 24 / 7 / 365</small></span></a><nav id="navigation" aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="#home">Home</a><a href="#programs">Our programs</a><a href="#catalog">Gift catalog</a><a href="#impact">Our impact</a><a href="#involved">Get involved</a></nav><div class="nav-actions"><a class="staff-link" href="#operations">Staff ↗</a><a class="btn lime" href="#give">Plan a gift ↗</a><button id="menu" class="menu" aria-controls="navigation" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle menu">☰</button></div></div></header>
<main id="main"><section class="page active" data-page="home"><div class="hero"><div class="shell hero-layout"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="overline light">✦ THE GOOD SAMARITAN MISSION · ALL YEAR LONG</p><h1>Little things.<br><em>Life-changing</em><br>kindness.</h1><p class="hero-lead">A toy that lights up a day. A warm coat that changes a winter. Food that brings a family to the table. Three ways to care, every single day of the year.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn lime big" href="#give">Explore ways to give ↗</a><a class="simple-link" href="#programs">↗ &nbsp; See our mission</a></div><p class="hero-caption">✳ &nbsp; ONE MISSION &nbsp; · &nbsp; THREE DEPARTMENTS &nbsp; · &nbsp; 365 DAYS</p></div><div class="hero-graphic" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orb"></div><span class="spark s1">✳</span><span class="spark s2">✦</span><span class="spark s3">✧</span><span class="spark s4">✳</span><div class="gift rear"><i></i><b></b></div><div class="gift front"><i></i><b></b><span>∞</span></div><div class="float-label upper">GOODNESS<br>GROWS HERE ↗</div><div class="float-label lower"><strong>24/7/365</strong><small>ONE CARING COMMUNITY</small></div></div></div><div class="hero-strip"><div class="shell">EMPATHY <span>✳</span> SYMPATHY <span>✳</span> COMPASSION <span>✳</span> ACTION</div></div></div>
<div class="shell section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="overline">THE HEART OF THE MISSION</p><h2>Three everyday ways<br>to make a difference.</h2></div><p>Every gift starts with a choice. Fund joy, warmth, nourishment—or bring all three together.</p></div><div class="program-cards" id="program-cards"></div></div>
<div class="feature"><div class="shell feature-grid"><div class="feature-graphic" aria-hidden="true"><div class="paper p1"></div><div class="paper p2"></div><div class="paper p3"></div><div class="heart">♥</div><div class="sticker">EVERY<br>SINGLE<br>DAY <span>✳</span></div></div><div class="feature-copy"><p class="overline">MORE THAN A HOLIDAY</p><h2>Because families need love in every season.</h2><p>Christmas remains the flagship. But birthdays don't wait for December. Neither do school clothes, a cold morning, or an empty pantry.</p><div class="feature-list"><div><b>01</b><span><strong>Christmas Giving</strong><small>Holiday gifts, family care and community drives</small></span></div><div><b>02</b><span><strong>365 Joy Circle</strong><small>Year-round contribution planning at every budget</small></span></div><div><b>03</b><span><strong>Community logistics</strong><small>Source carefully and document every handoff</small></span></div></div><a class="btn dark" href="#programs">Discover our programs ↗</a></div></div></div>
<div class="shell section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="overline">GIVING SHOULD FEEL POSSIBLE</p><h2>Start small. Make it count.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="#catalog">View all 24 giving levels ↗</a></div><div class="featured-tiers" id="featured-tiers"></div><p class="disclaimer">All package uses are illustrative. Prices and distribution quantities need supplier and partner validation.</p></div><div class="join"><div class="shell join-grid"><div><p class="overline light">THE EVERYDAY INVITATION</p><h2>Be part of something <em>good.</em></h2><p>Contribute, volunteer, host a collection drive or create a meaningful card.</p></div><div class="actions"><a href="#involved" class="btn lime">Find a way to help ↗</a><a href="#honor" class="btn outline-light">Make a tribute card</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="page" data-page="give"><div class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="overline light">MAKE KINDNESS A HABIT</p><h1>Choose your <em>way to give.</em></h1><p>Pick a department, a contribution level and a rhythm. This is a planning experience, not a payment checkout.</p></div></div><div class="shell section giving-grid"><div class="form-stack"><div class="card"><h2><span class="number">01</span> Where should your gift go?</h2><div class="options" id="departments"></div></div><div class="card"><h2><span class="number">02</span> Choose your contribution</h2><div class="tabs" id="frequencies"><button data-frequency="one_time" class="selected">One time</button><button data-frequency="monthly">Monthly</button><button data-frequency="annually">Annually</button></div><div class="amount-grid" id="amounts"></div><label for="amount" class="field-label">Or enter your own amount</label><div class="money-input"><span>$</span><input id="amount" type="number" min="5" max="100000" step="0.01" value="50"></div><p class="fine">24 giving levels between $5 and $100,000. Amounts are program budgets—not specific item guarantees.</p></div><div class="card"><h2><span class="number">03</span> Review and prepare</h2><label class="check"><input id="tribute-check" type="checkbox"> Create an honorary greeting too</label><button id="prepare" class="btn dark full">Create my giving plan ↗</button><p id="plan-status" class="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite">No payment has been made or scheduled.</p></div></div><aside><div class="summary"><p class="overline light">YOUR GIVING PLAN ✳</p><strong id="total">$50</strong><small id="period">One-time planned gift</small><hr><div><span>Department</span><b id="chosen-department">All three</b></div><div><span>Giving level</span><b id="chosen-tier">Holiday Helper</b></div><div><span>Payment status</span><b>Not charged</b></div><hr><p>Recurring payment authorization, receipts and tax deductibility are not yet connected or confirmed.</p><a class="btn lime full" href="#catalog">Explore all giving levels ↗</a></div><div class="side-note"><b>Clarity is kindness.</b><p>Gift plans are not donations or proof of payment.</p></div></aside></div></section>
<section class="page" data-page="catalog"><div class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="overline light">THE COMPLETE GIFT CATALOG</p><h1>A place for <em>every giver.</em></h1><p>24 original contribution levels, from your first $5 to community-scale sponsorship.</p></div></div><div class="shell section"><div class="filters"><label class="sr-only" for="search">Search giving levels</label><input type="search" id="search" placeholder="Search names or prices"><select id="group" aria-label="Filter giving levels"><option value="all">All levels</option></select><span id="results">24 levels</span></div><div class="tier-cards" id="tier-cards"></div><p class="disclaimer">Catalog packages are planning examples and cannot guarantee a quantity of items.</p></div></section>
<section class="page" data-page="programs"><div class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="overline light">WHAT WE'RE BUILDING</p><h1>Joy has <em>many forms.</em></h1><p>Christmas gifts, birthdays, education, emergency essentials and year-round community support.</p></div></div><div class="shell section"><div class="program-details" id="program-details"></div><div class="principles"><p class="overline light">THE RULE THAT MATTERS MOST</p><h2>Help is given with dignity.<br>No strings attached.</h2><p>Families are never required to appear in marketing, repay support, volunteer or participate in religious activities in exchange for basic assistance.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="page" data-page="honor"><div class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="overline light">A GIFT OF KINDNESS</p><h1>Make a meaningful <em>little card.</em></h1><p>Create a greeting to honor someone you love. It stays in your browser.</p></div></div><div class="shell section tribute-grid"><div class="card tribute-fields"><label class="field-label" for="honoree">In honor of</label><input id="honoree" maxlength="70" placeholder="Someone special"><label class="field-label" for="message">Your message</label><textarea id="message" maxlength="230" rows="5" placeholder="Wishing you joy, kindness and a little extra sparkle."></textarea><label class="field-label" for="signature">From</label><input id="signature" maxlength="70" placeholder="With love"><div class="actions"><button class="btn dark" id="print-card">Print greeting ↗</button><button class="btn border" id="copy-card">Copy words</button></div><p class="fine" id="card-status">The card does not submit personal information and is not a donation receipt.</p></div><div class="tribute-preview" id="tribute-preview"><span class="card-ornament">✳</span><small>A GIFT OF KINDNESS</small><h2>Some things are better<br>when <em>shared.</em></h2><strong id="card-for">For someone special</strong><p id="card-message">Wishing you joy, kindness and a little extra sparkle.</p><span id="card-from">With love</span><footer>CHRISTMAS TOY DRIVE · 24 / 7 / 365<br>Greeting only · Not proof of donation</footer></div></div></section>
<section class="page" data-page="involved"><div class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="overline light">NEIGHBORS HELPING NEIGHBORS</p><h1>There's room for <em>everyone.</em></h1><p>Plan goods donations, volunteer projects, community drives and support pathways.</p></div></div><div class="shell section"><div class="involved-cards" id="involved-cards"></div></div></section>
<section class="page" data-page="impact"><div class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="overline light">ACCOUNTABILITY IS AN ACT OF CARE</p><h1>See the work. <em>Know the truth.</em></h1><p>Donations, pledged plans and completed distributions are different things.</p></div></div><div class="shell section"><div class="alert"><b>● &nbsp; Public impact data is not connected</b><p>These fields will populate when payments and verified distribution records exist. No numbers are invented.</p></div><div class="metrics"><div><small>Verified donations</small><strong>—</strong><span>Payment settlement needed</span></div><div><small>Households served</small><strong>—</strong><span>Deduplicated handoffs needed</span></div><div><small>Items distributed</small><strong>—</strong><span>Verified delivery needed</span></div><div><small>Recurring retention</small><strong>—</strong><span>Confirmed donor cohort needed</span></div></div><div class="impact-grid"><div class="card"><p class="overline">HOW A DONATION BECOMES DELIVERY</p><h2>Five separate checkpoints</h2><ol><li>Verified payment settled</li><li>Restricted purpose recorded</li><li>Goods sourced and safety-checked</li><li>Recipient partner handoff documented</li><li>Aggregate results reviewed and published</li></ol></div><div class="card"><p class="overline">WHAT WE WILL MEASURE</p><h2>Clear, respectful reporting</h2><p>Money received, fees, refunds, inventory, delivery, response time, and cost per completed package.</p><p class="fine">No children’s names, addresses or identifiable family records appear in public reports.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="page" data-page="operations"><div class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="overline light">BEHIND EVERY GIFT</p><h1>Operations <em>workspace.</em></h1><p>A protected development console for planning records, inventory, campaigns and audit history.</p></div></div><div class="shell section"><div class="card login"><div><p class="overline">STAFF ONLY · DEVELOPMENT</p><h2>Connect to the operations API.</h2><p>No donor emails, payment secrets, children’s details or private household intake are stored in this prototype.</p></div><div><label for="staff-key" class="field-label">Server-side staff credential</label><input id="staff-key" type="password" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Enter development staff key"><button class="btn dark" id="connect">Open workspace ↗</button><p class="fine" id="staff-message" role="status">CTD_ADMIN_KEY must be set on the server.</p></div></div><div id="staff-workspace" hidden><div class="metrics" id="staff-metrics"></div><div class="work-grid"><div class="card"><p class="overline">INVENTORY</p><h2>Register stock</h2><label class="field-label" for="sku">SKU</label><input id="sku" placeholder="TOY-BLOCKS-001"><label class="field-label" for="item-title">Description</label><input id="item-title" placeholder="Building blocks"><label class="field-label" for="item-category">Department</label><select id="item-category"><option value="toys">Toys</option><option value="clothing">Clothing</option><option value="food">Food</option></select><button class="btn dark" id="add-item">Create SKU ↗</button><p id="inventory-message" class="fine" role="status"></p></div><div class="card"><p class="overline">CAMPAIGNS</p><h2>Create a draft</h2><label class="field-label" for="campaign-name">Campaign name</label><input id="campaign-name" placeholder="Winter Warmth"><label class="field-label" for="campaign-category">Department</label><select id="campaign-category"><option value="combined">All three</option><option value="toys">Toys</option><option value="clothing">Clothing</option><option value="food">Food</option></select><label class="field-label" for="campaign-goal">Budget goal (USD)</label><input type="number" id="campaign-goal" value="500" min="1"><button class="btn dark" id="add-campaign">Create draft ↗</button><p class="fine" id="campaign-message" role="status"></p></div></div><div class="work-grid"><div class="card"><p class="overline">STOCK MOVEMENT</p><h2>Receive or release goods</h2><label class="field-label" for="movement-item">Inventory SKU</label><select id="movement-item"><option value="">Choose SKU</option></select><label class="field-label" for="movement-reason">Movement</label><select id="movement-reason"><option value="receipt">Receive stock</option><option value="distribution">Record distribution</option><option value="correction">Correct count</option></select><label class="field-label" for="movement-units">Units (negative for outgoing)</label><input id="movement-units" type="number" step="1" min="-10000" max="10000" value="1"><label class="field-label" for="movement-ref">Reference (non-identifying)</label><input id="movement-ref" placeholder="BATCH-2026-001"><button class="btn dark" id="move-stock" type="button">Record stock movement ↗</button><p id="movement-message" class="fine" role="status"></p></div><div class="card"><p class="overline">SAFETY & INSPECTION</p><h2>Clear or block a SKU</h2><label class="field-label" for="safety-item">Inventory SKU</label><select id="safety-item"><option value="">Choose SKU</option></select><label class="field-label" for="safety-state">Review outcome</label><select id="safety-state"><option value="pending">Pending inspection</option><option value="cleared">Cleared for distribution</option><option value="blocked">Blocked — do not distribute</option></select><p class="fine">All new items begin pending. Food dates and toy recalls must be checked by staff before clearance.</p><button class="btn dark" id="save-safety" type="button">Record safety status ↗</button><p id="safety-message" class="fine" role="status"></p></div></div><div class="card"><p class="overline">FULFILLMENT PLANNING</p><h2>Record an anonymous batch</h2><div class="work-grid"><div><label class="field-label" for="batch-reference">Batch reference</label><input id="batch-reference" placeholder="HANDOFF-2026-001"><label class="field-label" for="batch-department">Department</label><select id="batch-department"><option value="toys">Toys</option><option value="clothing">Clothing</option><option value="food">Food</option></select></div><div><label class="field-label" for="batch-partner">Partner batch code</label><input id="batch-partner" placeholder="PARTNER-BATCH-001"><label class="field-label" for="batch-count">Item count</label><input id="batch-count" type="number" min="1" max="10000" value="1"></div></div><button class="btn dark" id="add-batch" type="button">Create planned handoff ↗</button><p class="fine" id="batch-message" role="status">Creating a batch is not evidence of delivery. Verified handoffs need documented partner review.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Stock register</h2><button class="btn border" id="refresh">Refresh ↻</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>SKU</th><th>Department</th><th>Quantity</th><th>Inspection</th></tr></thead><tbody id="stock-rows"></tbody></table></div></div><div class="card"><p class="overline">TRACEABILITY</p><h2>Audit events</h2><div id="audit-events"></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="page" data-page="faq"><div class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="overline light">THE IMPORTANT QUESTIONS</p><h1>Answers without <em>guesswork.</em></h1></div></div><div class="shell section faq"><details open><summary>Can I pay through this site today?</summary><p>No. The active flow creates a giving plan, not a charge. A payment merchant, verified webhooks, receipts and monthly cancellation tools are not connected.</p></details><details><summary>Can I claim a tax deduction?</summary><p>The legal recipient and federal tax-exempt status are not verified here. Do not assume the contribution is tax deductible.</p></details><details><summary>Does a $30 gift guarantee a particular toy or meal?</summary><p>No. The tier levels are illustrative budgets. Procurement costs and logistics will be verified with real suppliers before guarantees are made.</p></details><details><summary>Can I submit my child's personal information?</summary><p>No. This development website does not collect private family or child data. Secure referral partnerships will require separate review before launch.</p></details><details><summary>What happens to the original Nathan AI sites?</summary><p>They remain unchanged. This platform is additive and the existing Cash App draft has not been merged or represented as payment verification.</p></details></div></section>
</main><footer class="footer"><div class="shell footer-grid"><div><div class="footer-mark">✳</div><h3>Christmas Toy Drive</h3><p>One mission. Three departments. Every day of the year.</p><small>BY NATHAN TABOR · HANDLING LIFE · 24 / 7 / 365</small></div><div><b>Explore</b><a href="#programs">Programs</a><a href="#catalog">Gift catalog</a><a href="#honor">Tribute cards</a><a href="#impact">Transparency</a></div><div><b>Participate</b><a href="#give">Plan a contribution</a><a href="#involved">Volunteer & partners</a><a href="#faq">FAQs & safety</a></div><div><b>The wider network</b><a href="https://github.com/NathanAIoxr/Nathan-AI-Sovereign-Core" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Nathan AI source ↗</a><a href="#operations">Staff tools</a><span>Protecting innocence.</span></div></div><div class="shell footer-bottom">© 2026 CHRISTMAS TOY DRIVE · DEVELOPMENT PREVIEW <span>NO LIVE PAYMENTS · NO TAX CLAIM · NO CHILD DATA INTAKE</span></div></footer>
